750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) along edges of wall mounted rack used for knife sharper and flour scoop storage (flour/buildup);
B) cabinet under handsink in restroom (dust/debris/old mouse droppings);
C) bottom inside hotbox (food crumbs);  and
D) tracks of soda cooler (debris).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) pizza oven - rollers, catch trays, general surfaces along edges around rollers, and backside of the fan cover (food debris/buildup);
B) pan used for storage of bagged powdered sugar (powdered sugar/splash) - replaced with clean pan during inspection;
C) dough ball roller - general surfaces on underside/around conveyor and on back side of machine (grease/bits of old dough);
D) tool storage tub in back prep area (flour/splash);   and
E) box fan at the edge of the doorway by the reach-in freezer (dust).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

